WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:05.780
Here are some cooking tips straight from SCP-5031’s
brand new cookbook, “Quantum Cooking With

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:07.259
the Murder Monster!”

00:00:07.259 --> 00:00:12.120
Tip 1: Be sure to use all six of your arms
for ultimate cooking precision!

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:17.800
Kitchen knives are also no good - Be sure
to use your bladed tail for all cooking activities!

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.460
Tip 2: Cook to music!

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:24.789
My personal favorite is Jethro Tull, but ambient
mixes of calm morning forests will also do

00:00:24.789 --> 00:00:27.710
for getting you into that perfect cooking
zone.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:30.819
Tip 3: Pick only the best ingredients!

00:00:30.819 --> 00:00:34.830
Cooked rotisserie chickens taste much better
than volleyballs, I’ve learned this from

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:36.040
experience.

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:38.590
Tip 4: The kitchen is a special place.

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:42.730
If someone enters your kitchen and refuses
to respect your rules, cut them to pieces

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.750
with your bladed tail and turn them into a
nice goulash.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:48.040
They’ll be much better off that way!

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:50.820
Tip 5: More garlic powder is always a good
thing!

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:56.810
Quantum Cooking with the Murder Monster by
SCP-5031 is available at no good retailers.

00:00:56.810 --> 00:00:57.670
Pre-order now!

